# Dataset — each teammate keeps their own local copy here; never push 320 images to GitHub.
data/raw/

# Generated per-image outputs (enhanced .tif files) stay local/regenerable.
# Exception, added deliberately per pipeline once its tuning is actually
# finalised (not a blanket un-ignore): each pipeline's own FINAL locked-in
# NFIQ2 batch_results.csv, at the path the Batch tab in dashboard/app.py
# already writes it to (data/processed/<pipeline>/<db>/batch_results.csv)
# — so dashboard/results_loader.py's fallback source works without any
# code change. This does NOT re-include the enhanced .tif images sitting
# in the same folders, nor any of the *_before_*/*_exp*/-suffixed
# superseded-tuning-round backup directories (they don't match the exact
# pipeline_a/b/c/d names below).
data/processed/*
!data/processed/pipeline_a/
!data/processed/pipeline_b/
!data/processed/pipeline_c/
!data/processed/pipeline_d/
data/processed/pipeline_a/*
data/processed/pipeline_b/*
data/processed/pipeline_c/*
data/processed/pipeline_d/*
!data/processed/pipeline_a/*/
!data/processed/pipeline_b/*/
!data/processed/pipeline_c/*/
!data/processed/pipeline_d/*/
data/processed/pipeline_a/*/*
data/processed/pipeline_b/*/*
data/processed/pipeline_c/*/*
data/processed/pipeline_d/*/*
!data/processed/pipeline_a/*/batch_results.csv
!data/processed/pipeline_b/*/batch_results.csv
!data/processed/pipeline_c/*/batch_results.csv
!data/processed/pipeline_d/*/batch_results.csv

# Regenerable outputs / figures — keep the repo to code only. Exception,
# same reasoning as above: a pipeline's own FINAL result CSV(s) (per-image
# scores + summary/aggregate table), once actually finalised. Every sweep/
# tuning-round/experiment CSV (e.g. results/coherence_sweep_*.csv,
# results/log_gabor_add_gain_sweep_*.csv, anything *_before_*.csv) stays
# ignored — only the exact final filenames below are ever un-ignored.
results/*
!results/pipeline_c_ablation.csv
!results/pipeline_c_ablation_summary.csv
!results/pipeline_b_ablation.csv
!results/pipeline_b_ablation_summary.csv
!results/pipeline_b_worst_regressions.csv
# Pipeline D's own ablation tool (scripts/pipeline_d_ablation.py) writes to
# a subdirectory rather than a flat file — same exception pattern, applied
# one level deeper, ready for whenever that pipeline's results are final.
!results/pipeline_d_ablation/
results/pipeline_d_ablation/*
!results/pipeline_d_ablation/pipeline_d_ablation.csv
!results/pipeline_d_ablation/pipeline_d_ablation_summary.csv
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# Editor / OS
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Streamlit
.streamlit/
